{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44686","headline":"三不爲篇 三 · 海顺","name":"三不爲篇 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我欲衒才鬻德，入市趋朝。\n四衆瞻仰，三槐附交。\n标形引势，身达名超。\n箱盈绮服，厨富甘肴。\n讽扬弦管，咏美歌谣。\n将恐尘栖弱草，露宿危条。\n无过日旦，靡越风朝。\n是以还伤乐浅，非惟苦遥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"海顺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}